# Example CODEOWNERS for EngineeringSpec adopters.
# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace @your-team with real owners.
# Enable "Require review from Code Owners" on the protected branch / ruleset.
# Also protect this file so it cannot be silently rewritten in the same PR.

# Contracts that authorize file scope
/docs/engineering-specs/ @your-team

# Keep the ownership map itself trusted
/.github/CODEOWNERS @your-team

# Optional: CI wiring that runs the gate
/.github/workflows/ @your-team
